Interpretation
  The shell-1-full quotient keeps the B=13/S41 leader through B=24:
    E'=(0,1,2,4,6,7,8,10), w=12, Delta^+/p1=997/2562.
  Its exact 2p1/5 gap is 139/2450, and no scanned shell-full row crosses 2/5.
  Rows introducing speeds beyond 14 are much lower; their leader is below 1/3.
  The live proof target is therefore not a growing scalar frontier in this quotient,
  but a finite dyadic-even packet lemma around the B=13 leader.

